# OobSummary 的代码风格（csa-checker-dev 约定）。只管这个目录；入口 OobSummaryChecker.cpp 在上一级（那里是 LLVM 的风格），
# 格式化它时显式指定本文件：clang-format -i --style=file:clang/lib/StaticAnalyzer/Checkers/OobSummary/.clang-format <文件>
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120
PointerAlignment: Right
DerivePointerAlignment: false
SortIncludes: false
UseTab: Never
BreakBeforeBraces: Custom
BraceWrapping:
  AfterFunction: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AccessModifierOffset: -4
NamespaceIndentation: None
Standard: Cpp11
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
MaxEmptyLinesToKeep: 1
# 不重排注释：中文按显示宽度（一字两列）计，重排会把注释拆坏
ReflowComments: false
